==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|-}} and {{der|en|frm|absterger}} or from {{der|en|ML.|abstergēre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|abstergeō||wipe off or away}}; formed from {{der|en|la|abs-}} + {{m|la|tergeō||to wipe off}}.

