* {{IPA|en|/æbˈstɝd͡ʒ/|/əbˈstɝd͡ʒ/|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Persent101-absterge.wav|a=US}}
* {{hyphenation|en|ab|sterge}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɜː(ɹ)dʒ|s=2}}

